	/// KPI delta triplets for the non-exec pages (#178), same silhouette as the Overview KPIs
	/// (#117/#165): hidden PP prior-window / Delta (% for counts, pp for ratios) / never-blank Label /
	/// sentiment-aware Color where the direction is unambiguous. Value cards bind the plain base measure.
